{"unit_id":"drowned-fish1__deepseek-harness-skillx#feature-1","repo":"drowned-fish1/deepseek-harness-skillx","commit":"baf8d166e27b36805da4884a1b30db997cdf9708","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skillx 的功能「结构化能力请求」：把任务、所需能力、输入输出类型和语言等整理成可比较的请求。Agent 在需要搜索外部 Skill 前生成该请求，用它确定候选范围和评估标准。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:50-77"]}
{"unit_id":"drowned-fish1__deepseek-harness-skillx#feature-2","repo":"drowned-fish1/deepseek-harness-skillx","commit":"baf8d166e27b36805da4884a1b30db997cdf9708","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-skillx 的功能「候选搜索与比较」：按本地项目、本地已装 Skills、官方来源、社区列表和公开仓库等顺序查找候选，并按适配度等维度比较多个选项。通过 Agent 的搜索和阅读流程触发，结果用于选择适合当前需求的候选。","source":"generated","evidence":["SKILL.md:79-97","SKILL.md:122-148"]}
